# Depala, Pilot Exemplar's two statics (CR 613.4c). Bot1's other Dwarf, Kili the Resourceful (1/2), is a 2/3 while Depala herself
# stays 3/3 ("Other"). Bot1's Smuggler's Copter is not a creature until crewed (crew 1, tapping Kili), so on turn 3 it is a 4/4
# once crewed, "as long as it's a creature". Bot2's Kili and crewed Copter (crewed on turn 4 by its Llanowar Elves) get nothing:
# "you control". Bot1's Copter, uncrewed again on turn 4, is no creature again and has no power to raise.

